Package: SoilGeoStats
Title: Geostatistical Modelling of Topsoil Data (Organic Carbon)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Adebola David", "Adedayo", , "adebolaadedayo21@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: SoilGeoStats provides robust tools to ingest topsoil data in geographic tables,
    carry out spatial clipping using vector boundary shapefiles, a simple exploratory data analysis,
    and execute both deterministic modelling and advanced multivariate geostatistical analysis.
    The target users of this package are spatial data analysts, environmental scientists,
    soil ecologists and researchers who work with soil points datasets and need a quick,
    reproducible pipeline to clip, validate and carry out geostatistical interpolation.
